  Three remaining user actions (require credentials/console access):
  1. Replace YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY in AndroidManifest.xml and AppDelegate.swift
  2. Replace YOUR_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID in ios/Runner/Info.plist with value from GoogleService-Info.plist
  3. Add SHA fingerprints to Firebase Console for Android Google Sign-In, then run firebase functions:secrets:set OWM_API_KEY


To activate the Maps widget, replace the two placeholder values in android/local.properties and ios/Flutter/SecretKeys.xcconfig with your real key from Google Cloud Console. That is the only action needed — no source files need to be touched.            